# Search filter for ripgrep-based tools (Claude Code Grep/Glob, rg). Files stay readable on purpose.
# Unity serialized YAML: use scripts/unity-inspect.sh instead of searching it.
*.meta
*.unity
*.prefab
*.asset
*.mat
*.anim
*.controller
*.overrideController
*.physicMaterial
*.lighting
*.shadergraph
*.vfx
*.spriteatlas
*.spriteatlasv2
Assets/ThirdParty/
Assets/Plugins/
Assets/TextMesh Pro/
Packages/packages-lock.json
ProjectSettings/
